                 lh: "C3 | G2:h C3:h | C3 | G2:h C3:h | C3 | G2:h C3:h | C3 | G2:h C3:h", pos: "G3 C4 D4 E4"),
            Song(id: "songs.easy.jolly-st-nick", title: "Jolly Old Saint Nicholas", summary: "A Christmas song built from repeated notes.",
